  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up the 12+ Programme-empowerment of 12 year old girls in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver empowerment of 10-12 year old girls in Rwanda. By 2016 the programme will improve the health, social and economic assets  and increase the self-esteem of 114,500 girls. It will result in less tolerance for gender based violence amongst girls, community support for girls&#x2019; participation in the programme and implementation of girl focused policies at national level. This will contribute to improving the quality of life for women and girls in Rwanda and delivering the MDGS, specifically it will contribute to reduced maternal mortality, reduced proportion of girls and young women who have ever experienced sexual or physical violence and increased proportion of girls completing lower secondary school.</narrative>
  </description>
